# API catalog

Base: `{apiDomain}/api`. Response shape usually `{ success, data, error? }`. Banking list meta: `{ total, limit, offset, total_debit, total_credit, net_cashflow }`.

**Auth gate**: everything under `/api` needs session cookie except `GET /health`, `POST /auth/login`, `POST /auth/logout`, `GET /config`.

## Health / config

| Method | Path | File |
|--------|------|------|
| GET | `/health` | `server.js` (dbType, dbOk, uptime) |
| GET | `/config` | `routes/config.js` → ignorePlatforms, dbType, database presets, embeddedMysql |
| POST | `/config/database` | switch MySQL host at runtime (preset localhost/docker/custom) |
| POST | `/auth/login` | `{ username, password, rememberMe }` → `pfm_session` cookie |
| POST | `/auth/logout` | `routes/auth.js` |
| GET | `/auth/me` | `routes/auth.js` — requires session |

## Investments — `routes/investments.js` + `db/*-store.js`

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/investments` | all |
| GET | `/investments/search?website_app_name&sub_type_name&sub_type_category` | |
| GET/PUT/DELETE | `/investments/:id` | |
| POST | `/investments` | MF with `mutual_fund_scheme_code` auto-resolves NAV via `mf-api.resolveNav` |
| GET/POST | `/investments/transactions` | investment_transactions (buy/sell/dividend/interest/fee/deposit/withdrawal/transfer_*); sign from type |
| PUT/DELETE | `/investments/transactions/:txnId` | |

## Mutual funds — `routes/mutual-funds.js` + `utils/mf-api.js`

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/mutual-funds/search?q=` | mfapi.in search (min 2 chars) |
| GET | `/mutual-funds/:schemeCode/latest` | |
| GET | `/mutual-funds/:schemeCode/history?startDate&endDate` | |
