## Banking — `routes/banking.js` + `db/banking.js` + `banking-advanced.js`

| Area | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Accounts | CRUD `/banking/accounts`, `/banking/accounts/:id` |
| Continuity | GET `/banking/accounts/:id/continuity` |
| Txns | CRUD `/banking/transactions`; POST `bulk-categorize`, `bulk-delete` |
| Recat | POST `/banking/recategorize` (`account_id`, `mode` auto_only\|uncategorized\|all) |
| Categories | GET `/banking/categories` |
| Rules | CRUD `/banking/rules`; POST `/banking/rules/test` |
| Analytics | GET `/banking/analytics` (summary, byCategory/Month, interestTax, interestByMonth, mom/yoy, insights…), `/analytics/by-payee` |
| MF / ETF | GET `/banking/investment-flows?account_id&from&to` → `db/investment-flows.js` (`bank`, `holdings`, `reconciliation`, `insights`) |
| Cash | GET `/banking/cash-summary` (cash vs credit-card totals, stale accounts) |
| Duplicates | GET `/banking/duplicates/scan`, POST `/duplicates/clean` |
| Budgets | CRUD `/banking/budgets`, GET `/budgets/status`, POST `/budgets/copy` |
| Recurring | GET `/banking/recurring` |
| Transfers | POST `/transfers/match`, GET `/transfers/matched`, POST `/transfers/unmatch` |
| Forecast | GET `/banking/forecast` |
| Import | POST `/banking/import` (multer `file`, `account_id`, `bank_hint`, `pdf_password`|`password`), `/import/preview`; DELETE `/import/batches/:batchId` |
| Export / backup | GET `/banking/export/transactions` (xlsx\|csv\|pdf, statement\|raw layout); POST `/banking/import/transactions` (raw backup restore) |

Parsers: `utils/bank-parsers/index.js` — HDFC/ICICI/ICICI-CC CSV/DCB/SBI/Axis/Kotak + generic CSV/XLS; password Excel via `office-file.js`. **PDF**: HDFC / ICICI / SBI credit-card PDFs (password OK); savings/current PDFs rejected.
